  "preregisteredAt": "2026-07-05T09:00:00+08:00",
  "objective": "Audit whether fixed-rule LPPLS and linear DMD diagnostics can later be studied as HMM auxiliary observations, transition covariates, or state-interpretation variables rather than independent trading signals.",
  "source": {
